abulary/CdcPublisherNames_APIS?v=2.0',454),(10824,'','FSD',NULL,5,10481,NULL,'Finnish Social Science Data Archive (FSD)','https://vocabularies.cessda.eu/vocabulary/CdcPublisherNames_FSD?v=2.0',454),(10825,'France','ProgedoSciencesPo',NULL,11,10485,NULL,'PROGEDO: Sciences Po','https://vocabularies.cessda.eu/vocabulary/CdcPublisherNames_ProgedoSciencesPo?v=2.0',454),(10826,'Belgium','SODA',NULL,14,NULL,NULL,'SODA','https://vocabularies.cessda.eu/vocabulary/CdcPublisherNames_SODA?v=2.0',454),(10828,'Using automated means to retrieve information from data sources and save it to a local file or database for further processing or storage. Use this term if it is not known what kind of automated technique has been used or if the technique is known but not listed as a narrower term.','AutomatedDataExtraction',NULL,36,NULL,NULL,'Automated data extraction','https://ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CV/ModeOfCollection_4.0.html#AutomatedDataExtraction',452),(10829,'Retrieving information from online data sources through an API (application programming interface) to save it to a local file or database for further processing or storage.','AutomatedDataExtraction.ApiQuery','AutomatedDataExtraction',37,NULL,NULL,'Automated data extraction: API query','https://ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CV/ModeOfCollection_4.0.html#AutomatedDataExtraction.ApiQuery',452),(10830,'Retrieving information from databases through a query to the database to extract only the information required, saving it to a local file or database for further processing or storage.','AutomatedDataExtraction.DatabaseQuery','AutomatedDataExtraction',38,NULL,NULL,'Automated data extraction: Database query','https://ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CV/ModeOfCollection_4.0.html#AutomatedDataExtraction.DatabaseQuery',452),(10831,'A technique employed to extract large amounts of data from websites and save it to a local file or database for further processing or storage. Also called screen scraping, web data extraction, 