herType\" attribute. Use the complex element controlledVocabUsed (in the docDscr section) to identify the controlled vocabulary to which the selected term belongs.</p><p>Element/Attribute Name: <a href=\"http://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-Codebook/2.5/XMLSchema/field_level_documentation_files/schemas/codebook_xsd/elements/sumStat.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">sumStat</a></p>','Specifies the type of summary statistic. Summary statistics are a single number representation of the characteristics of a set of values.',NULL,249,'SL','en',NULL,NULL,1,'SummaryStatisticType','This vocabulary was first published by the DDI Alliance. Please see: https://ddialliance.org/controlled-vocabularies/all.','2.1',0,'2019-05-07',NULL,'PUBLISHED','Summary Statistic Type',NULL,NULL,'https://ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CV/SummaryStatisticType_2.1.html',NULL,'','',54,'2020-09-30',NULL),(250,'urn:ddi:int.ddi.cv:SamplingProcedure:1.1','DDI Alliance. (2019). Sampling Procedure (Version 1.1) [Controlled vocabulary]. CESSDA. urn:ddi:int.ddi.cv:SamplingProcedure:1.1. ',40,'<p><a href=\"https://ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-Lifecycle/3.3/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">DDI3.3</a></p><p>Module name: datacollection</p><p>Element name: <a href=\"https://ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-Lifecycle/3.3/XMLSchema/FieldLevelDocumentation/schemas/datacollection_xsd/elements/TypeOfSamplingProcedure.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">TypeOfSamplingProcedure</a></p><p><a href=\"https://ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-Lifecycle/3.3/XMLSchema/FieldLevelDocumentation/schemas/datacollection_xsd/elements/TypeOfSample.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">TypeOfSample</a></p><p><br></p><p><a href=\"http://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-Lifecycle/3.2/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">DDI 3.2</a></p><p>Module Name: datacollection</p><p>Element Name: <a href=\"http://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/D