yStatistic</a></p><p><br></p><p><a href=\"http://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-Codebook/2.5/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">DDI 2.5</a></p><p>Element Number in DDI 2.1: 4.3.14</p><p>Element/Attribute Name: <a href=\"http://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-Codebook/2.5/XMLSchema/field_level_documentation_files/schemas/codebook_xsd/elements/sumStat.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">sumStat</a></p>','Gibt die Art der zusammenfassenden Statistik an. Das sind statistische Parameter, die einen bestimmten Satz von Werten beschreiben.',NULL,271,'TL','de',NULL,NULL,1,'SummaryStatisticType',NULL,'2.1.1',0,NULL,NULL,'DRAFT','Art der zusammenfassenden Statistik','GESIS - Leibniz Institute for the Social Sciences','https://www.gesis.org',NULL,'https://ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CV/SummaryStatisticType_2.1.html',NULL,NULL,54,'2020-09-30',NULL),(272,'urn:ddi:int.ddi.cv:SummaryStatisticType:2.1','DDI Alliance. (2019). Typ av sammanfattande statistik [Summary Statistic Type] (Version 2.1.1; Swedish National Data Service (SND), Transl.) [Controlled vocabulary]. CESSDA. urn:ddi:int.ddi.cv:SummaryStatisticType:2.1. ',40,'<p><a href=\"https://ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-Lifecycle/3.3/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">DDI3.3</a></p><p>Module name: physicalinstance</p><p>Element name: <a href=\"https://ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-Lifecycle/3.3/XMLSchema/FieldLevelDocumentation/schemas/physicalinstance_xsd/elements/TypeOfSummaryStatistic.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">TypeOfSummaryStatistic</a></p><p><br></p><p><a href=\"http://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-Lifecycle/3.2/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">DDI 3.2</a></p><p>Module Name: physicalinstance</p><p>Element Name: <a href=\"http://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-Lifecycle/3.2/XMLSchema/FieldLevelDocumentation/schemas/physicalinstance_xsd/elements/TypeOfSummaryStatistic.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer