ner noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">CharacterSet</a></p><p><br></p><p><a href=\"http://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-Codebook/2.5/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">DDI 2.5</a></p><p>Element/Attribute name: <a href=\"http://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-Codebook/2.5/XMLSchema/field_level_documentation_files/schemas/xhtml-datatypes-1_xsd/simpleTypes/Charset.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"> @charset</a></p>','Standard set of characters upon which many character encodings are based (Wikipedia).',NULL,274,'SL','en',NULL,NULL,1,'CharacterSet','This vocabulary lists some popular character sets but is not exhaustive. If the character set is not mentioned in the list, use \'Other\' for this element and enter the specific name into the OtherValue element. You can search for the name of the character set in the list published by IANA (Internet Assigned Character Numbers). Use the \"preferred MIME-name\" if the IANA list specifies one, otherwise use the format in the Name field - http://www.iana.org/assignments/character-sets.\n\nThe vocabulary was first published by the DDI Alliance. Please see: https://ddialliance.org/controlled-vocabularies/all.','1.0',0,'2020-02-04',NULL,'PUBLISHED','Character Set',NULL,NULL,'https://ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CV/CharacterSet_1.0.html',NULL,'','',58,'2020-09-30',NULL),(275,'urn:ddi:int.ddi.cv:CommonalityType:1.0','DDI Alliance. (2019). Commonality Type (Version 1.0) [Controlled vocabulary]. CESSDA. urn:ddi:int.ddi.cv:CommonalityType:1.0. ',49,'<p><a href=\"https://ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-Lifecycle/3.3/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">DDI3.3</a></p><p>Module name: comparative</p><p>Element name: <a href=\"https://ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-Lifecycle/3.3/XMLSchema/FieldLevelDocumentation/schemas/comparative_xsd/elements/CommonalityTypeCoded.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">CommonalityTypeCoded</a></p><p><br></p><p><a href=\"http://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-Lifecycle/3.2/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">DDI 3.2</a></p><p>Module name: comparative</p><p>Element name: <a href=\"http://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-Lifecycle/3.2/XMLSchema/FieldLevelDocumentation/schemas/comparative_xsd/elements/CommonalityTypeCoded.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">CommonalityTypeCoded</a> </p><p><br></p><p><a href=\"http://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-Codebook/2.5/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">DDI 2.5</a></p><p>DDI-Codebook (DDI 2.5 and all previous DDI versions) does not include an element or attribute that would support this controlled vocabulary.</p>','Describes the degree of similarity between two items or schemes (collections of items).',NULL,275,'SL','en',NULL,NULL,1,'CommonalityType','This vocabulary was first published by the DDI Alliance. Please see: https://ddialliance.org/controlled-vocabularies/all','1.0',0,'2019-05-20',NULL,'PUBLISHED','Commonality Type','','','https://ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CV/CommonalityType_1.0.html',NULL,'','',59,'2020-09-30',NULL),(276,'urn:ddi:int.ddi.cv:DataType:1.0','DDI Alliance. (2019). Data Type (Version 1.0) [Controlled vocabulary]. CESSDA. urn:ddi:int.ddi.cv:DataType:1.0. ',49,'<a href=\"http://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-Lifecycle/3.2/\">DDI 3.2</a> \n<div>\n  Module name: reusable \n</div> \n<div>\n  Element name: \n <a href=\"http://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-Lifecycle/3.2/XMLSchema/FieldLevelDocumentation/schemas/reusable_xsd/elements/DefaultDataType.html\"> DefaultDataType</a> \n</div> \n<div> \n <span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>&nbsp; \n <a href=\"http://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-Lifecycle/3.2/XMLSchema/FieldLevelDocumentation/schemas/reusable_xsd/elements/RecommendedDataType.html\">RecommendedDataType</a> \n</div> \n<div> \n <br /> \n</div> \n<div> \n <a href=\"http://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-Codebook/2.5/\">DDI 2.5</a> \n</div> \n<div>\n Element/Attribute name: \n <a href=\"http://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-Codebook/2.5/XMLSchema/field_level_documentation_files/schemas/codebook_xsd/elements/varFormat.html\">varFormat@category</a>\n</div>','Identifies the type of data, which has a bearing on the acceptable data values, the operations that can be performed with the data, and the ways in which the data are stored.',NULL,276,'SL','en',NULL,NULL,1,'DataType','This vocabulary was first published by the DDI Alliance. Please see: https://ddialliance.org/controlled-vocabularies/all. The present list is based on the W3C data types (http://www.w3.org/TR/xmlschema-2/), and includes the terms relevant for documenting research data.','1.0',0,'2019-11-24',NULL,'PUBLISHED','Data Type',NULL,NULL,'https://ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CV/DataType_1.0.html',NULL,'','',60,'2020-09-30',NULL),(277,'urn:ddi:int.ddi.cv:DateType:1.1','DDI Alliance. (2019). Date Type (Version 1.1) [Controlled vocabulary]. CESSDA. urn:ddi:int.ddi.cv:DateType:1.1. ',49,'<p><a href=\"https://ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-Lifecycle/3.3/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">DDI3.3</a></p><p>Module name: reusable</p><p>Element name: <a href=\"https://ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-Lifecycle/3.3/XMLSchema/FieldLevelDocumentation/schemas/reusable_xsd/elements/DateTypeCode.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">DateTypeCode</a></p><p><br></p><p><a href=\"http://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-Lifecycle/3.2/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">DDI 3.2</a></p><p>Module name: reusable</p><p>Element name: <a href=\"http://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-Lifecycle/3.2/XMLSchema/FieldLevelDocumentation/schemas/reusable_xsd/elements/DateTypeCode.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">DateTypeCode</a></p><p><br></p><p><a href=\"http://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-Codebook/2.5/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">DDI 2.5</a></p><p>Element/Attribute name: <a href=\"https://ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-Codebook/2.5/XMLSchema/field_level_documentation_files/schemas/codebook_xsd/elements/varFormat.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">varFormat@category</a></p><p>For the \"category attribute\", a value from a controlled vocabulary may be provided if the \"other\" value is chosen. In this case, the term from the controlled vocabulary should be placed in the \"otherCategory\" attribute, and the controlledVocabUsed element (in the Document Description section) should also be filled in.</p>','Specifies the type of date.\n',NULL,277,'SL','en',NULL,NULL,1,'DateType','The present list is based on ISO 8601 usage.\nThis vocabulary was first published by the DDI Alliance. Please see: https://ddialliance.org/controlled-vocabularies/all.','1.1',0,'2019-11-24',NULL,'PUBLISHED','Date Type',NULL,NULL,'https://ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CV/DateType_1.1.html',NULL,'','',61,'2020-09-30',NULL),(278,NULL,NULL,40,'<p><a href=\"https://ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-Lifecycle/3.3/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">DDI3.3</a></p><p>Module name: physicalinstance</p><p>Element name: <a href=\"https://ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-Lifecycle/3.3/XMLSchema/FieldLevelDocumentation/schemas/physicalinstance_xsd/elements/TypeOfSummaryStatistic.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">TypeOfSummaryStatistic</a></p><p><br></p><p><a href=\"http://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-Lifecycle/3.2/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">DDI 3.2</a></p><p>Module Name: physicalinstance</p><p>Element Name: <a href=\"http://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-Lifecycle/3.2/XMLSchema/FieldLevelDocumentation/schemas/physicalinstance_xsd/elements/TypeOfSummaryStatistic.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">TypeOfSummaryStatistic</a></p><p><br></p><p><a href=\"http://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-Codebook/2.5/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">DDI 2.5</a></p><p>Element Number in DDI 2.1: 4.3.14</p><p>Element/Attribute Name: <a href=\"http://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-Codebook/2.5/XMLSchema/field_level_documentation_files/schemas/codebook_xsd/elements/sumStat.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">sumStat</a></p>','Spesifiserer typen av sammenfattende statistikk. Sammenfattende statisitkk er en representasjon av et sett verdiers karakteristika representert ved et enkelt tall.','Den norske oversettelsen må ses over igjen. ',278,'TL','no',NULL,NULL,1,'SummaryStatisticType',NULL,'2.1.1',0,NULL,NULL,'REVIEW','Typen av sammenfattende statistikk','NSD - Norwegian Centre for Research Data','https://nsd.no/',NULL,'https://ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CV/SummaryStatisticType_2.1.html',NULL,NULL,54,'2020-09-30',NULL),(279,'urn:ddi:int.ddi.cv:SummaryStatisticType:2.1','DDI Alliance. (2019). Typen af sammenfattende statistik [Summary Statistic Type] (Version 2.1.1; Danish National Archives (DNA), Transl.) [Controlled vocabulary]. CESSDA. urn:ddi:int.ddi.cv:SummaryStatisticType:2.1. ',40,'<p><a href=\"https://ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-Lifecycle/3.3/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">DDI3.3</a></p><p>Module name: physicalinstance</p><p>Element name: <a href=\"https://ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-Lifecycle/3.3/XMLSchema/FieldLevelDocumentation/schemas/physicalinstance_xsd/elements/TypeOfSummaryStatistic.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">TypeOfSummaryStatistic</a></p><p><br></p><p><a href=\"http://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-Lifecycle/3.2/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">DDI 3.2</a></p><p>Module Name: physicalinstance</p><p>Element Name: <a href=\"http://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-Lifecycle/3.2/XMLSchema/FieldLevelDocumentation/schemas/physicalinstance_xsd/elements/TypeOfSummaryStatistic.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">TypeOfSummaryStatistic</a></p><p><br></p><p><a href=\"http://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-Codebook/2.5/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">DDI 2.5</a></p><p>Element/Attribute Name: <a href=\"http://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-Codebook/2.5/XMLSchema/field_level_documentation_files/schemas/codebook_xsd/elements/sumStat.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">sumStat</a></p>','Specificerer typen af sammenfattende statistik. Sammenfattende statistik er en repræsentation af et sæt af værdiers karakteristika ved hjælp af et enkelt tal.',NULL,279,'TL','da',NULL,NULL,1,'SummaryStatisticType',NULL,'2.1.1',0,'2019-07-22',NULL,'PUBLISHED','Typen af sammenfattende statistik','Danish National Archives (DNA)','https://www.sa.dk/','https://ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CV/SummaryStatisticType_2.1.1.html','https://ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CV/SummaryStatisticType_2.1.html','','',54,'2020-09-30',NULL),(280,'urn:ddi:int.ddi.cv:LanguageProficiency:1.0','DDI Alliance. (2020). Language Proficiency (Version 1.0) [Controlled vocabulary]. CESSDA. urn:ddi:int.ddi.cv:LanguageProficiency:1.0. ',49,'<p><a href=\"https://ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-Lifecycle/3.3/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">DDI3.3</a></p><p>Module name: archive</p><p>Element name: <a href=\"https://ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-Lifecycle/3.3/XMLSchema/FieldLevelDocumentation/schemas/archive_xsd/elements/Read.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Read</a></p><p> &nbsp;<a href=\"https://ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-Lifecycle/3.3/XMLSchema/FieldLevelDocumentation/schemas/archive_xsd/elements/Write.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Write</a></p><p> &nbsp;<a href=\"https://ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-Lifecycle/3.3/XMLSchema/FieldLevelDocumentation/schemas/archive_xsd/elements/Speak.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Speak</a>  </p><p><br></p><p><a href=\"http://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-Lifecycle/3.2/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=