ecification/DDI-CV/TypeOfInstrument_1.1.html','','',52,'2020-09-30',NULL),(413,'urn:ddi:int.ddi.cv:CommonalityType:1.0','DDI Alliance. (2020). Vrste sličnosti [Commonality Type] (Version 1.0.1; Data Centre Serbia for Social Sciences (DCS), Transl.) [Controlled vocabulary]. CESSDA. urn:ddi:int.ddi.cv:CommonalityType:1.0. ',63,'<p><a href=\"https://ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-Lifecycle/3.3/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">DDI3.3</a></p><p>Module name: comparative</p><p>Element name: <a href=\"https://ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-Lifecycle/3.3/XMLSchema/FieldLevelDocumentation/schemas/comparative_xsd/elements/CommonalityTypeCoded.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">CommonalityTypeCoded</a></p><p><br></p><p><a href=\"http://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-Lifecycle/3.2/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">DDI 3.2</a></p><p>Module name: comparative</p><p>Element name: <a href=\"http://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-Lifecycle/3.2/XMLSchema/FieldLevelDocumentation/schemas/comparative_xsd/elements/CommonalityTypeCoded.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">CommonalityTypeCoded</a> </p><p><br></p><p><a href=\"http://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-Codebook/2.5/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">DDI 2.5</a></p><p>DDI-Codebook (DDI 2.5 and all previous DDI versions) does not include an element or attribute that would support this controlled vocabulary.</p>','Opisuje stepen sličnosti između dve stavke, predmeta ili šeme (zbirke stavki).',NULL,413,'TL','sr',NULL,NULL,1,'CommonalityType','','1.0.1',0,'2020-01-12',NULL,'PUBLISHED','Vrste sličnosti','Data Centre Serbia for Social Sciences (DCS)','http://datacentarserbia.com','https://ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CV/CommonalityType_1.0.1.html','https://ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CV/CommonalityType_1.0.html','','',59,'2020-09-30',NULL),(415,'urn:ddi:int.ddi.cv:AggregationMethod:1.1','DDI Alliance. (2019). Aggregation Method (Version 1.1) [Controlled vocabulary]. CESSDA. urn:ddi:int.ddi.cv:AggregationMethod:1.1. ',49,'<p><a href=\"https://ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-Lifecycle/3.3/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">DDI 3.3</a></p><p>Module name: reusable</p><p>Element name: <a href=\"https://ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-Lifecycle/3.3/XMLSchema/FieldLevelDocumentation/schemas/reusable_xsd/elements/AggregationMethod.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"> AggregationMethod</a></p><p><br></p><p><a href=\"http://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-Lifecycle/3.2/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">DDI 3.2</a></p><p>Module name:&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;reusable</p><p>Element name:&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"http://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-Lifecycle/3.2/XMLSchema/FieldLevelDocumentation/schemas/reusable_xsd/elements/AggregationMethod.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"> AggregationMethod </a></p><p><br></p><p><a href=\"http://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-Codebook/2.5/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">DDI 2.5</a></p><p>Element/Attribute name: <a href=\"http://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-Codebook/2.5/XMLSchema/field_level_documentation_files/schemas/codebook_xsd/elements/var.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">var@otherAggrMeth</a></p><p>Element/Attribute name: <a href=\"http://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-Codebook/2.5/XMLSchema/field_level_documentation_files/schemas/codebook_xsd/elements/measure.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">measure@otherAggrMeth</a></p>','Identifies the type of aggregation used to combine related categories, usually within a common branch of a hierarchy, to provide information at a broader level than the level at which detailed observations are taken. (From: The OECD Glossary of Statistical Terms)','',268,'SL','en',NULL,NULL,1,'AggregationMethod','This vocabulary was first published by the DDI Alliance. Please see: https://ddialliance.org/controlled-vocabularies/all.','1.1',268,'2019-11-24',NULL,'PUBLISHED','Aggregation Method',NULL,NULL,'https://ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CV/AggregationMethod_1.1.html',NULL,'Code descriptive term rephrased: Arithmetic Mean rephrased into Arithmetic mean\nCode descriptive term rephrased: Cumulative Percent rephrased into Cumulative percent\nCode descriptive term rephrased: Percentile Rank rephrased into Percentile rank\nCode definition rephrased: Count\nCode definition rephrased: Mode\n','1. ArithmeticMean, CumulativePercent, PercentileRank: Descriptive term capitalization changed to make them conform to the other vocabularies. 2. Count, Mode: Period added at the end of the code definitions to make them conform to the other vocabularies.',57,'2020-09-30',NULL),(417,'urn:ddi:int.ddi.cv:NumericType:1.1','DDI Alliance. (2019). Numeric Type (Version 1.1) [Controlled vocabulary]. CESSDA. urn:ddi:int.ddi.cv:NumericType:1.1. ',49,'<p><a href=\"https://ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-Lifecycle/3.3/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">DDI3.3</a></p><p>Module name: reusable</p><p>Element name: <a href=\"https://ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-Lifecycle/3.3/XMLSchema/FieldLevelDocumentation/schemas/reusable_xsd/elements/NumericTypeCode.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">NumericTypeCode</a></p><p><br></p><p><a href=\"http://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-Lifecycle/3.2/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">DDI 3.2</a></p><p>Module name: reusable</p><p>Element name: <a href=\"http://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-Lifecycle/3.2/XMLSchema/FieldLevelDocumentation/schemas/reusable_xsd/elements/NumericTypeCode.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">NumericTypeCode</a></p><p><br></p><p><a href=\"http://www.ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-Codebook/2.5/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">DDI 2.5</a></p><p>Element/Attribute name: <a href=\"http://www.ddialliance.org/Specificatio