rki, til at tilvejebringe information på et bredere niveau end det, på hvilket detaljerede observationer er foretaget. (Fra: OECD-ordlisten med statistiske begreber)',NULL,NULL,'Identifies the type of aggregation used to combine related categories, usually within a common branch of a hierarchy, to provide information at a broader level than the level at which detailed observations are taken. (From: The OECD Glossary of Statistical Terms)',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,NULL,'AggregationMethod','',NULL,'2019-11-24','en','PUBLISHED',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Aggregeringsmetode',NULL,NULL,'Aggregation Method',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CV/AggregationMethod',NULL,NULL,NULL,'1.1.1',NULL,NULL,'1.1',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1.1',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0'),(58,2,'ddi.png','DDI Alliance',_binary '',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Standard set of characters upon which many character encodings are based (Wikipedia).',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,_binary '\0',NULL,NULL,'CharacterSet','This vocabulary lists some popular character sets but is not exhaustive. If the character set is not mentioned in the list, use \'Other\' for this element and enter the specific name into the OtherValue element. You can search for the name of the character set in the list published by IANA (Internet Assigned Character Numbers). Use the \"preferred MIME-name\" if the IANA list specifies one, otherwise use the format in the Name field - http://www.iana.org/assignments/character-sets.',NULL,'2020-02-04','en','PUBLISHED',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Character Set',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,N